\title{Synthetic fibered #{(∞,1)}-category theory}
\author{jonathanweinberger}
\author{ulrikbuchholtz}
\tag{hott}
\tag{refereed}
\meta{doi}{10.21136/HS.2023.04}
\meta{arxiv}{2105.01724}
\meta{venue}{[[higher-structures]] 7(1)}
\taxon{Reference}
\date{2023-05-21}

\subtree{
\taxon{Abstract}
\p{
We study cocartesian fibrations in the setting of the synthetic #{(∞,1)}-category
theory developed in simplicial type theory introduced by [Riehl](emilyriehl) and
[Shulman](michaelshulman). Our development culminates in a Yoneda Lemma for
cocartesian fibrations.
}
}

